    {
      "s": 0.55,
      "e": 3.14,
      "text": "(upbeat music)"
    },
    {
      "s": 13.3,
      "e": 17.0,
      "text": "- Our mission is important because if we don't go do it,"
    },
    {
      "s": 17.0,
      "e": 19.23,
      "text": "who else is gonna go do it?"
    },
    {
      "s": 19.23,
      "e": 20.96,
      "text": "And who better to go do it than"
    },
    {
      "s": 20.96,
      "e": 22.13,
      "text": "the Florida National Guard for"
    },
    {
      "s": 22.13,
      "e": 24.13,
      "text": "the citizens of Florida?"
    },
    {
      "s": 25.89,
      "e": 28.47,
      "text": "(dogs barking)"
    },
    {
      "s": 28.95,
      "e": 32.28,
      "text": "We have come across well over 50 victims"
    },
    {
      "s": 32.73,
      "e": 34.38,
      "text": "that have been trapped in one way,"
    },
    {
      "s": 34.38,
      "e": 35.8,
      "text": "shape or another,"
    },
    {
      "s": 35.8,
      "e": 37.57,
      "text": "that really needed attention,"
    },
    {
      "s": 37.57,
      "e": 38.94,
      "text": "needed medical help."
    },
    {
      "s": 38.94,
      "e": 41.72,
      "text": "And fortunately, we were able to get to them in time"
    },
    {
      "s": 41.72,
      "e": 44.55,
      "text": "and get them the help they needed."
    },
    {
      "s": 50.08,
      "e": 53.2,
      "text": "And when my team members come in at night"
    },
    {
      "s": 53.2,
      "e": 55.53,
      "text": "and tell me the things they saw during the day,"
    },
    {
      "s": 55.53,
      "e": 57.86,
      "text": "they're emotionally affected by it,"
    },
    {
      "s": 57.86,
      "e": 59.13,
      "text": "but it gives them the drive"
    },
    {
      "s": 59.13,
      "e": 61.88,
      "text": "to go out and do it the next day."
    },
    {
      "s": 62.96,
      "e": 65.71,
      "text": "(engine revving)"
    },
    {
      "s": 72.5,
      "e": 74.75,
      "text": "This is by far the most catastrophic one"
    },
    {
      "s": 74.75,
      "e": 76.37,
      "text": "that we have been to."
    },
    {
      "s": 76.37,
      "e": 79.12,
      "text": "And everyone of the people on this team,"
    },
    {
      "s": 79.12,
      "e": 80.53,
      "text": "they're here for the duration."
    },
    {
      "s": 80.53,
      "e": 81.5,
      "text": "They're here as long as they need"
    },
    {
      "s": 81.5,
      "e": 82.34,
      "text": "to get the job done."
    },
    {
      "s": 82.34,
      "e": 84.23,
      "text": "And make sure that every one of the citizens"
    },
    {
      "s": 84.23,
      "e": 87.46,
      "text": "have been touched and know that we're here to help them."
    },
    {
      "s": 87.46,
